: "", "solution_text": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">The office exists to serve him, not the other way round.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Option 1</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> sends him away for a second trip.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Option 3</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> leaves him with the same difficulty.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Option 4</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> is useful only if the Hindi form is handed over</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">and he can read it.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Option 2</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> gets the work done now,</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">and reading the entries back protects him from</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">signing something he has not understood.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Answer: Option 2</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "solution_video": "", "sortingparam": "0.00"}, {"answer": "3", "correct_score": "1", "deleted": "0", "difficulty_level": "0", "id": "50047", "negative_score": "1", "option_1": {"en": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Uncle</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_2": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Cousin</span></p>", "h