er</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Answer: Option 3 – Brother</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "solution_video": "", "sortingparam": "0.00"}, {"answer": "1", "correct_score": "1", "deleted": "0", "difficulty_level": "0", "id": "50048", "negative_score": "1", "option_1": {"en": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">North-east, 9 km east</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_2": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">North-east, 7 km east</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_3": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">North-west, 9 km east</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_4": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">South-east, 9 km east</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_5": "", "option_image_1": "", "option_image_2": "", "option_image_3": "", "option_image_4": "", "option_image_5": "", "question": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Rohan starts from his house and walks 8 km towards the north. He then turns right and walks 6 km, turns right again and walks 4 km, and finally turns left and walks 3 km. In which direction is he now from his house, and how far east of it?</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "question_image": "", "quiz_id": "cgl-2026-tier2-mock9-hindi", "solution_heading": "", "solution_image": "", "solution_text": {"en": "  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Follow each leg on the figure.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">8 km north — he is now 8 km above the house.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">A right turn faces him </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">east</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — 6 km east.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">A right turn now faces him </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">south</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — 4 km south.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">A left turn faces him </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">east</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> again — 3 km east.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">East in all: 6 + 3 = </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">9 km</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">North in all: 8 − 4 = </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">4 km</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">9 km east and 4 km north put him to the </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">north-east</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Answer: Option 1 – North-east, 9 km east</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-size:12pt\"><img src=\"https://static-appxdb-v2.akamai.net.in/website/bulk_uploader_images/1792671746739_image001.png\" width=\"289\" height=\"260\" alt ></p>", "hi": ""}, "solution_video": "", "sortingparam": "0.00"}, {"answer": "4", "correct_score": "1", "deleted": "0", "difficulty_level": "0", "id": "50049", "negative_score": "1", "option_1": {"en": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">They differ in both the name and the PIN code</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_2": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">They differ only in the plot number</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_3": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">The two addresses are exactly the same</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_4": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">They differ only in the spelling of the name</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_5": "", "option_image_1": "", "option_image_2": "", "option_image_3": "", "option_image_4": "", "option_image_5": "", "question": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Two addresses are given below. Compare them carefully and select the option that correctly describes them.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Address I: Mrs. Bhattacharya, Flat 44-A, Sunrise Residency, Plot No. 75, Sector 13-B, Saket, New Delhi – 110083</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Address II: Mrs. Bhattacharaya, Flat 44-A, Sunrise Residency, Plot No. 75, Sector 13-B, Saket, New Delhi – 110083</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "question_image": "", "quiz_id": "cgl-2026-tier2-mock9-hindi", "solution_heading": "", "solution_image": "", "solution_text": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Read the two lines part by part.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Flat, building, plot, sector, locality, city and PIN —</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">identical in both.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">The name is </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Bhattacharya</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> in the first and </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Bhattacharaya</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> in the second.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Nothing else differs.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Answer: Option 4 – They differ only in the spelling of the name</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "solution_video": "", "sortingparam": "0.00"}, {"answer": "2", "correct_score": "1", "deleted": "0", "difficulty_level": "0", "id": "50050", "negative_score": "1", "option_1": {"en": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Only conclusion I follows</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_2": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Only conclusion II follows</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_3": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Both conclusions I and II follow</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_4": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Neither conclusion I nor II follows</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "option_5": "", "option_image_1": "", "option_image_2": "", "option_image_3": "", "option_image_4": "", "option_image_5": "", "question": {"en": " <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Two statements are given, followed by two conclusions numbered I and II. Taking the statements to be true even if they seem to differ from commonly known facts, decide which of the conclusions follows from the statements.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Statements:</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">I. All bricks are stones.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">II. All stones are tiles.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Conclusions:</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">I. All tiles are stones.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">II. Some stones are bricks.</span></p>", "hi": ""}, "question_image": "", "quiz_id": "cgl-2026-tier2-mock9-hindi", "solution_heading": "", "solution_image": "", "solution_text": {"en": "  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Draw the statements exactly as they are given.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">All bricks are stones</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — the bricks circle sits inside stones.</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">All stones are tiles</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — that circle in turn sits inside tiles.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Conclusion I</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — it does not follow.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">The picture allows tiles that lie outside stones.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Conclusion II</span><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> — it follows.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\">All bricks are stones, so some stones certainly are bricks.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:4pt;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:'Cambria Math'\">Answer: Option 2 – Only conclusion II follows</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-size:12pt\"><img src=\"https://static-appxdb-v2.akamai.net.in/website/bulk_uploader_images/1792671746739_image002.png\" width=\"184\" height=\"184\" alt ></p>", "hi": ""}, "solution_video": "", "sortingparam": "0.00"}]}